<section id="how-to-play" class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
            <p class="eyebrow">How to play</p>
            <h2 id="how-title">Four steps to <span class="text-gradient">crack the code</span></h2>
            <p>The quest of the game is to discover the multiplication operation.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="steps">
            <li class="step card">
                <h3>Study the board</h3>
                <p>The board shows the following multiplications: <code>A &times; B</code> and <code>B &times; A</code>. The numbers do not begin with zero.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step card">
                <h3>Fill every x</h3>
                <p>You must fill all missing digits represented by <code>x</code> in the board. To play, <kbd>click</kbd> on an <code>x</code> and enter the number you think it may be.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step card">
                <h3>Change your mind</h3>
                <p>To revert a filled digit you have three options:</p>
                <ul class="undo">
                    <li>Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> and then <kbd>click</kbd> on the box with a digit</li>
                    <li><kbd>Click</kbd> on the box with a digit and press <kbd>Delete</kbd></li>
                    <li><kbd>Click</kbd> on the box with a digit and press <kbd>Backspace</kbd></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="step card">
                <h3>Finish the grid</h3>
                <p>The game ends when all <code>x</code>'s are removed, with one of two possible outcomes: you discovered the multiplication, or you see the answer and try again!</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
}
.step {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2.4rem 1.5rem 1.6rem;
    counter-increment: step;
}
.step::before {
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.1rem;
    left: 1.4rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.6rem;
    height: 2.6rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--grape), var(--pink));
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px -6px var(--pink);
}
.step:nth-child(2)::before { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--coral)); }
.step:nth-child(3)::before { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sky), var(--grape)); }
.step:nth-child(4)::before { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mint), var(--sky)); }
.step h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: .5rem;
}
.step p, .undo {
    color: var(--muted);
}
.undo {
    display: grid;
    gap: .5rem;
    margin: .75rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: .95rem;
}
.undo li {
    padding: .55rem .75rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface-tint);
}
</style>
